  "worked_solution": "To subtract $-480$ from $-235,$ we combine the two negative signs to make a single plus sign. This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-235-(-480) & = \\\\ -235+480 & = \\\\ 245 & .\\end{aligned}\n$$",
